      "description": {
        "fun": "Riolu sees feelings like joy and rage as waves of aura, and it talks with others of its kind silently through the shapes of their auras. When it's scared or sad, its aura flares up to warn the others. It has stamina to spare: it can cross three mountains and two canyons in one night, which makes taking it for a walk a challenge. Its name is Lucario's, minus the 'ca'.",
        "guide": "Riolu is a Fighting-type baby Pokémon that can sense aura, which lets it read others' emotions and communicate silently. It has great stamina and can run all night. It evolves into Lucario when it is very attached to its Trainer, during the day.",
