      "description": {
        "fun": "Lucario reads auras to sense the feelings of creatures more than half a mile away, and no foe can hide from it, not even an invisible one. Sometimes it learns things it would rather not know, so it gets stressed easily. Its jackal look and sense of justice bring to mind Anubis, who weighed souls in Egyptian myth. Fans voted it the most popular Generation 4 Pokémon in 2020.",
